    "content": "<style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><div><style>\n  .email {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 40px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"640\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:36px 36px 0px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Dear {{ subscriber.first_name }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Good morning!</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">We hope this email finds you well. We are thrilled to remind you about the upcoming FP&amp;A webinar that we will be facilitating tomorrow.</p><h3 style=\"font-family:Charter, Georgia, Times New Roman, serif;font-size:28px;color:#11363F;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none\" class=\"\"><strong>Event Details</strong></h3><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Date:</strong> Thursday January 18, 2024.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Facilitators: Paul Barnhurst (aka the FP&amp;A guy) and Ron Monteiro (aka the Storytelling guy)</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Time: </strong>12-1pm EST, 11-12 CST, 10-11 MST, 9-10 PST</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<a href=\"https://streamyard.com/watch/PjYsHxbrVk7Q\" trigger-id=\"4242557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Click here to join the webinar</a>\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">We are planning an exciting and practical session, and will be sharing some practical tools and experience that we share with our students that will help you understand and excel in FP&amp;A. Don&#x27;t miss this opportunity to gain valuable knowledge and enhance your skills AND have some fun.</p><h3 style=\"font-family:Charter, Georgia, Times New Roman, serif;font-size:28px;color:#11363F;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none\" class=\"\"><strong>Agenda Highlights</strong></h3><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>\u200b</strong></p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">At this webinar, we will provide real-world content from our FP&amp;A Course on what makes a world-class FP&amp;A professional and team. This content comes from our World-Class FP&amp;A Course.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u00b7 </p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span>The BLUF principle</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>4 pillars of trust</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Real-world examples</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>What, So What, Now What examples</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Please mark your calendar and use the following link to join the webinar on the specified date and time: </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<a href=\"https://streamyard.com/watch/PjYsHxbrVk7Q\" trigger-id=\"4242557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Click here to join the webinar</a>\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">We look forward to your active participation and engagement in this session.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<br/> Warm regards,<br/>\u200b<br/> Paul Barnhurst<br/> The FP&amp;A Guy<br/>\u200b<br/> Ron Monteiro<br/> The Storytelling guy</p></div></div></td><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div><!--[if mso]><br /><br /><![endif]--></div></center></div><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 0px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:18px 36px 18px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:520px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">{{ address }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-h